	(text "POWER STAGE PCB NOTES\n\n1. 72V single-channel PDLC H-Bridge Power Stage.\n2. Use 2-layer PCB minimum; 2 oz copper preferred.\n3. Keep +72V_HV, PGND_CH0, OUT_A, OUT_B, PDLC_A and PDLC_B wide and short.\n4. Place C13, C14, C15 and R31 close to Q1~Q4.\n5. Keep IRS2104 drivers close to MOSFET gates.\n6. Keep HO/LO gate traces short and away from OUT_A/OUT_B.\n7. Route R9 current sense using Kelvin traces.\n8. Keep PGND_CH0 separate from logic GND except at R9 reference point.\n9. Place L1, L2, C10 and J9 near the PDLC output side.\n10. J9 must connect to filtered nodes PDLC_A / PDLC_B.\n11. Keep at least 1.5 mm clearance around 72V and switching nodes.\n12. Verify XT60H-F connector footprint with actual part before PCB fabrication."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 275.59 31.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b91e3e60-1407-4b36-bafe-59b8d645435c")
	)
